# Vendored Stripe skills: fetched from docs.stripe.com via `npx skills add`,
# not hand-written. Marked so they don't skew language stats and so GitHub
# collapses them by default in review — 33 files that would otherwise drown
# any diff that re-vendors them. Still fully expandable, which is the point:
# these run with full agent permissions, so drift should stay auditable.
.claude/skills/stripe-apps/**                              linguist-vendored=true linguist-generated=true
.claude/skills/stripe-best-practices/**                    linguist-vendored=true linguist-generated=true
.claude/skills/stripe-directory/**                         linguist-vendored=true linguist-generated=true
.claude/skills/stripe-docs/**                              linguist-vendored=true linguist-generated=true
.claude/skills/stripe-projects/**                          linguist-vendored=true linguist-generated=true
.claude/skills/upgrade-stripe/**                           linguist-vendored=true linguist-generated=true
.claude/skills/connect-recommend/**                        linguist-vendored=true linguist-generated=true
.claude/skills/connect-required-verification-information/** linguist-vendored=true linguist-generated=true
